	•	Predictors (Input Variable Bias): Low Risk | Quote/Reasoning: Predictors were routinely collected clinical characteristics after LTx, including diagnosis, ECMO, PGD3, ventilatory variables, and 6MWT, which are clinically relevant to AS risk.  ￼
